    },
    {
      "id": "gdev0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -760,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 4540,
      "height": 620,
      "label": "运行与开发入口",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "u001a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2280,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 用户\n浏览器中的聊天会话"
    },
    {
      "id": "f001a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1900,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Vue 3 前端\n- 会话管理与消息列表\n- 输入框与会话切换\n- 默认仅展示最终答案\n- Pinia + Vite + TypeScript"
    },
    {
      "id": "f002a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1900,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 流式聊天编排\nfrontend/src/api/chat.ts\nfrontend/src/composables/useChatStream.ts\n- 解析 SSE 结构化事件\n- AbortController 停止生成\n- 同步会话与消息"
    },
    {
      "id": "f003a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1900,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 消息与图表渲染\nMessageItem.vue\nChartArtifactCard.vue\n- Markdown 最终答案\n- CSV 下载入口\n- chart_id 拉取 ECharts 图表"
    },
    {
      "id": "b001a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -420,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## FastAPI 接口层\nbackend/app/main.py\nbackend/app/api.py\n- /api/chat/message\n- /api/chat/stream\n- /sessions /messages\n- /files/{file_id}\n- /charts/{chart_id}"
    },
    {
      "id": "b002a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## FastAPI 兼容服务层\nbackend/app/services.py\n- initialize / get / shutdown\n- 聚合 token、tool、final、error\n- 为 LangSmith 追加 metadata / tags"
    },
    {
      "id": "b003a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## SQLAgent Core\nbackend/app/agent/service.py\n- create_agent 装配模型、工具与中间件\n- 本地 FastAPI 模式手动创建 checkpointer\n- LangGraph 托管模式走 build_agent_graph\n- thread_id 绑定 session_id"
    },
    {
      "id": "b004a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 工具与中间件\nbackend/app/agent/tools/*\nbackend/app/agent/middleware/*\nbackend/app/skills/registry.py\n- SQLDatabaseToolkit + 包装查询\n- Skill / ContextWarning / BusinessRag / Summarization\n- build_chart_artifact / export_to_csv / SQL 示例检索"
    },
    {
      "id": "b005a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 会话与状态持久化\nbackend/app/database.py\nbackend/app/models.py\n- chat_sessions / chat_messages\n- AsyncPostgresSaver / PostgresSaver\n- FastAPI 生命周期中初始化与关闭"
    },
    {
      "id": "d001a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1980,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 业务数据库\nanalytics_db 或 rollerbed 源库\nMaterializedViewSQLDatabase\n- 注入表注释与 schema 信息\n- 提供 SQL 查询与统计结果"
    },
    {
      "id": "d002a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1980,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## RAG 知识检索\nbackend/app/agent/vector/*\n- pgvector 或 Milvus Hybrid\n- embedding provider\n- 可选 NVIDIA Rerank\n- 为业务问答与 SQL 示例提供补充上下文"
    },
    {
      "id": "d003a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2740,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 大模型服务\n默认 DeepSeek / ChatOpenAI\n可切换 Ollama\n- llm_timeout\n- max_retries\n- agent_max_tokens"
    },
    {
      "id": "d004a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2740,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Artifact 与下载存储\nbackend/app/chart_artifacts.py\nbackend/app/export_files.py\n- chart_id / file_id 注册\n- TTL 过期控制\n- 前端通过 ID 安全读取"
    },
    {
      "id": "r001a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 本地运行入口\nrun_backend.py -> backend/app/main.py\nstartup:\n- create_tables()\n- initialize_agent_service()\nshutdown:\n- shutdown_agent_service()"
    },
    {
      "id": "r002a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## LangGraph Dev 入口\nlanggraph.json\nagent = backend/app/agent/service.py:build_agent_graph\n- 托管模式不显式绑定 checkpointer / store"
    },
    {
      "id": "r003a1b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 文档入口\nREADME.md\n- 功能概览\n- 环境变量\n- 前后端启动方式\n- Docker 部署说明"
    }
  ],
